<li>Davis, Raymond. The Book of Pontiffs (Liber Pontificalis). Liverpool University Press, 1989.</li>
<li>Duffy, Eamon. Saints and Sinners: A History of the Popes. Yale University Press, 2006.</li>
</ul>

